# `;` does not start a comment in GLib.
-- options --
mydumper-version: v0.19.1-3
-- input.cnf --
[mydumper]
; nightly dump
routines=1
-- diagnostics --
2:1-2:15 error MDL113[unsupported-flag-without-value] `; nightly dump` is not a comment for GLib, only `#` starts one, and mydumper v0.19.1-3 does not rewrite it into a key (GLib: Key file contains line “; nightly dump” which is not a key-value pair, group, or comment)
  = mydumper ignores this entire file: it only logs a WARNING ("Failed to load config file") and runs with its defaults, exit code 0.
